<h2>Requirements</h2>
<ul>
<li>One USB drive 16 GB or more</li>
<li>One laptop preferably 64 bits, intel or AMD, and 8 GB RAM, and 1TB SSD</li>
<li>Another laptop pretty much any specs, preferably a model where you can remove the wifi antena and storage drives HDD and SSD</li>
<li>Screwdrivers to open the laptop</li>
<li>Password manager accounts preferably Bitwarden pro and Proton Pass paid plan</li>
<li>Archival paper like rite in the rain duracopy. If you plan on creating metal backups you can use regular paper.</li>
<li>3 Stainless steel 304 metal sheets, dog tags or even washers will do fine</li>
<li>Metal stamp kit: metal rods 1mm 0-9 optionaly A-F or A-Z if you can't find A-F, metal base, and any hammer</li>
</ul>
